{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102930","id":2338385866,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6LYO_K","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102930","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102930.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102930.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102930","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102930/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102930/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102930/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/279505d8b06e4f9f8f9c11309439c9892bcc710d","number":102930,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize `GDScriptLambdaCallable` by skipping the unnecessary `ObjectDB` lookup for `script`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"For a [proposal](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11787), I profiled `Array.filter` calls.\r\n\r\n11% of the time was spent on `GDScriptLambdaCallable::is_valid()`. I was able to optimize the function by skipping an unnecessary validation, speeding up the throughput of `Array.filter` by 10% (almost the full contribution of `is_valid`). This optimization affects all lambda calls, and thus functions operating on them.\r\n\r\nThe change should be safe for 4.4, but I'll let maintainers decide if they agree.\r\n\r\n## Explanation\r\n\r\n`GDScriptLambdaCallable::is_valid` holds its `script` as `Ref<GDScript>`. GDScript is `RefCounted`, so `GDScriptLambdaCallable` owns a reference to it. This guarantees that `script` is valid, and does not need to be further validated.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url"